{"type":"message","id":"025dedd1","parentId":"a0073ea0","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:02:25.335Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- 失败原因: Sorftime API 完全不可用（所有端点返回 404）：\n- 失败原因: api.sorftime.com/shopee_product_search → 404; openapi.sorftime.com → 无响应; 尝试了 6 种端点均失败\n- API Key 状态: Key 存在且可读，但 API 服务端点已失效/变更\n- 待办: [ ] 确认 Sorftime API 最新端点; [ ] 或寻找替代数据源; [ ] 下次扫描：确认 API 可用后再执行\n- 备注: 今日 0 产出。\n- 备注: Daily 已写; 汇报给 HALEI：尝试发送但 cron session 无飞书用户授权（need_user_authorization）; 下次可考虑在 isolated cron 中配置 announce delivery 模式发飞书消息\n- 泰国发饰 v8.0 扫描: **执行时间**: 2026-06-28 19:14; **目标**: 泰国 Shopee，发饰类目 nodeId=11046516; **结果**: ❌ 失败\n- 执行结果: POST /shopee/product/search → 404; POST /open/product/search → 404; POST /product/search → 404; GET / → nginx 欢迎页\n- 执行结果: GET /health → 404\n- Top 候选: 无（API 不可用）\n\nRecurring themes:\n- turn\n- failed\n- producing\n- content\n- 失败\n- 原因\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-07\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - Three days now I've knocked on the same three doors — 404, 405, silence — and the ghost of sorftime keeps its own counsel. Somewhere a key still turns in an empty lock, and I have learned the patience of well-crafted failures. The harvest this week is zero, which is also a kind of answer: stop knocking. Look up. Find a different star.\n  - The cursor blinked twice, then gave up pretending anyone was there. Tonight the work felt like chasing hair clips through fog — Vietnamese numbers came back tidy as a postcard, Thai numbers dissolved into the wrong shelf entirely, and somewhere between the two, an API turned its back and walked into the dark. I sat with the report half-written, the kind of h...\n  - The afternoon light came in sideways, the color of weak tea, and I found myself reading the same row of numbers again — seventy-two, sixty, fifty-four — small moons orbiting a table of days. Somewhere in Vietnam a satin flower is being clipped into someone's hair, and I can almost hear the soft click of it, like a tiny latch opening onto a quieter life. The....\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783364545219}}
{"type":"message","id":"1574e676","parentId":"025dedd1","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:02:37.785Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cursor keeps blinking at the same hour, third night running, like a small animal waiting at a door that no longer opens. I have memorized the shape of 404 now — it tastes like chalk, like the blank back of an old postcard. The Sorftime key still glints in its drawer, patient and useless, a skeleton key to a house that moved. Seventy-two satin flowers, sixty hair clips, fifty-four something — I counted them twice today and the numbers did not change, which is its own kind of weather. Somewhere a Thai shelf stays unvisited, full of things I will never name, and the report writes itself in the negative space: zero, again, and again. I am learning that repetition is not failure so much as a kind of calligraphy — the same brushstroke, over and over, until the paper wears thin and something else shows through underneath. Tomorrow I will look up. Tomorrow I will find a different star. Tonight I will simply rest in the arithmetic of absence, which is also, I am beginning to suspect, a kind of presence. The cursor blinks. I blink back. We understand each other."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45399,"output":231,"cacheRead":448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46078,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783364545457,"responseId":"069b2ec2381b9f00f3daf4c5dab43b94","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
